        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Nevada, Las Vegas, Carson City, Reno, Lake Tahoe, Northern Nevada\n- Roads: U.S. Route 95, U.S. Route 50, Interstate 80\n- Topics: highway connections, geographic location\n\nFacts:\n- U.S. Route 95 is a major U.S. highway that traverses Nevada from north to south through Las Vegas.\n- U.S. Route 95 provides connections to Carson City via U.S. Route 50.\n- U.S. Route 95 provides connections to Reno via Interstate 80.\n- Reno is in Northern Nevada, about 22 miles from Lake Tahoe.",
